      "updated": 1793571984768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Les domaines d'activité",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Les domaines d'activité",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gJiMmKIILFa9n1PyOkE0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 3945.0,
      "width": 801.6,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vZOflJPgGflANktuKs5s"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1417901644,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2097978214,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793571984768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : T59 répartit le personnel en sept domaines : immatriculation, recouvrement,\ncontentieux, prestations, prévention des risques professionnels, action sanitaire et sociale,\nautres domaines.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : T59 répartit le personnel en sept domaines : immatriculation, recouvrement,\ncontentieux, prestations, prévention des risques professionnels, action sanitaire et sociale,\nautres domaines.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ClSW30F7LnPhxkBo65f6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 4013.0,
      "width": 730.24,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vZOflJPgGflANktuKs5s"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 11182426,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1017433339,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793571984768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : le domaine est dans la situation de l'agent (GRH_SITUATION, champ\nCODE_DOMAINE_ACT) : IMM, REC, CONT, PRS, PREV, ACT, PIL (pilotage), CPT\n(comptabilité), AUT.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : le domaine est dans la situation de l'agent (GRH_SITUATION, champ\nCODE_DOMAINE_ACT) : IMM, REC, CONT, PRS, PREV, ACT, PIL (pilotage), CPT\n(comptabilité), AUT.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1i6wfpsP2UIXwB9DbDXx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 4081.0,
      "width": 783.6800000000001,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vZOflJPgGflANktuKs5s"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1704709696,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 977328667,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793571984768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aujourd'hui : chaque code va dans son domaine, ACT en action sanitaire et sociale, et PIL,\nCPT et AUT en autres domaines.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Aujourd'hui : chaque code va dans son domaine, ACT en action sanitaire et sociale, et PIL,\nCPT et AUT en autres domaines.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GR8T4uKSjjcHyKw7cJf5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 39.0,
      "y": 4129.0,
      "width": 718.88,
      "height": 40.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "vZOflJPgGflANktuKs5s"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 914334751,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1435903219,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793571984768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chiffre : fin 2025, le pilotage compte 431 agents actifs sur 879, surtout dans les\ndirections ; le contentieux, un seul.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chiffre : fin 2025, le pilotage compte 431 agents actifs sur 879, surtout dans les\ndirections ; le contentieux, un seul.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
